      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_CKahSql4",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_bx2Zh1An"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_mHr1jFYQ",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "Let’s take a quick look at where we’re headed in this short course on OpenMAIC storage smoke testing."
        },
        {
          "id": "action_PwsE5nin",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_EGTSgf0C"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_GKlV6lUF",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "First, we’ll answer the question ‘What is OpenMAIC?’ – it’s the framework that lets us run lightweight storage smoke tests quickly and reliably."
        },
        {
          "id": "action_GwT5zP2i",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_EGTSgf0C"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_bmyQzya3",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "Next, we’ll discuss why those smoke tests matter: they catch obvious storage‑related failures early, saving time and preventing downstream bugs."
        },
        {
          "id": "action_c7joYcYT",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_EGTSgf0C"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_yomwZLID",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "Finally, I’ll walk you through the course agenda and our learning goals, so you know exactly what you’ll be able to do by the end."
        },
        {
          "id": "action_4Zgwb0yt",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "By the end of today’s overview, you’ll see how each piece fits together and feel confident about the path forward."
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": 1777971128437,
      "updatedAt": 1777971128437
    },
